    <h2>About the author</h2>

    <p>Chad Gracia has spent 25 years advising venture funds and high-net-worth investors on private markets &mdash; the last ten focused exclusively on pre-IPO secondaries. For six years he directed the U.S. Commerce Department&rsquo;s private equity and venture capital trade missions to the Middle East. He is a registered representative of Rainmaker Securities, LLC, member FINRA/SIPC.</p>

